{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regex-theory","title":"正则表达式的理论根基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/regex-theory","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"formal-languages","title":"形式语言与正则语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/formal-languages","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"regex-syntax-semantics","title":"正则语法与语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/regex-syntax-semantics","wordCount":1540,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>在动手实现任何引擎之前，必须先把「正则表达式」这个词说清楚，否则后面所有的工程取舍都会站在流沙上。这一章就是整个 hub 的概念地基，它不写一行匹配算法，只回答三个递进的问题。</p>\n<p>第一个问题是「正则表达式的数学根基是什么」。答案要追溯到 Kleene 1951 年提出的正则代数，以及它背后那条把表达式、自动机、语法三者绑在一起的等价链。这一篇建立的「闭包」「连接」「选择」三种基本运算，是后续每一篇都会反复引用的词汇。</p>\n<p>第二个问题是「什么样的语言才算正则语言」。形式语言理论给出了精确的边界：泵引理告诉我们 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^n b^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这样的语言不正则，Chomsky 层级告诉我们正则语言处在表达力金字塔的最底层。理解这条边界，才能理解为什么工程上的回引让正则「越界」，从而注定无法用纯自动机实现。</p>\n<p>第三个问题是「程序员写的语法如何对应到这套理论」。从 <code>*</code> 到 <code>{2,5}</code>，从字符类到锚点，每一个语法糖背后都有一个形式语义，也都有「贪婪还是惰性」「匹配还是搜索」这样的歧义需要消解。</p>\n<p>三篇文档从纯理论一路走到工程语法，构成一条完整的下降路径：理论根基为形式语言提供工具，形式语言为语法语义划定边界，语法语义则把抽象代数翻译成你键盘上敲出的字符。读完这一章，你将带着一套精确的词汇进入第二章，去看这些抽象如何被编译成一台真正会跑的机器。</p>\n"}